# Hardware Direct

# Bambu Studio HMS error descriptions and recovery-action dictionary.
# https://github.com/bambulab/BambuStudio/blob/master/src/slic3r/GUI/HMS.cpp
# Complete JSON transfers succeeded on both paths; direct median times were lower.
DOMAIN,e.bambulab.com

# SUNLU product and technical-information website; stable direct transfers.
# https://www.sunlu.com/support/faq
# Prefer direct for this workload's modest proxy benefit; include the observed log spelling.
DOMAIN,www.sunlu.com
DOMAIN,www\.sunlu.com

# OpenRGB website and device-support data; direct samples were consistently successful.
# Release binaries are linked to separate hosts and are not covered by this exact rule.
# https://openrgb.org/releases.html
DOMAIN,openrgb.org
